                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "I had productive conversations with @kansashospitals, @ASLRRA, and @GAManufacturers.\n\nWe discussed the importance of strong rural hospitals, the critical role short line railroads play in connecting Kansas producers to markets, and the need to strengthen American aviation manufacturing. Thank you to these groups for the work they do to keep our state at the forefront of innovation.",
