                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Rural hospitals like Wamego Health Center are essential to keeping Kansas communities strong and healthy. I had a great visit with their team to discuss how Congress can support the essential services rural hospitals provide to communities across the Big First. \n\nI\u2019m grateful for the dedicated health care professionals who show up every day to care for their neighbors. Thank you for all you do.",
