                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Pharmacy Benefit Managers have driven up costs and hurt patients for too long. I cosponsored the PBM Reform Act to increase transparency in the industry and ban abusive drug pricing.\n\nThis is a commonsense step to bring accountability to the prescription drug supply chain.",
