                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Rural communities deserve strong, reliable health care.\n\nCongressional Republicans and President Trump\u00a0created a $50 billion Rural Health Transformation Program to strengthen hospitals, expand access, and support providers in rural communities like those in western Kansas. This is a major win for the Big First and rural America.",
